ds\":\r\n                return 4;\r\n            case \"2pair\":\r\n                return 3;\r\n            case \"1pair\":\r\n                return 2;\r\n            case \"high card\":\r\n                return 1;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        return 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    //Skill_exchangingHandsAgain用\r\n    public ArrayList<Player> getPlayers() {\r\n        return players;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n}\r\n
